{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vqx8zudk","slide":1,"text":"我们需要可控的 profile、cache policy、服务化接口和后续在线部署能力，这要求运行时必须完全可改、可测、可演进。","textPreview":"我们需要可控的 profile、cache policy、服务化接口和后续在线部署能力，这要求运行时必须完全可改、可测、可演进。","textChars":64,"textLines":1,"bbox":[160,293,564,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u5o7qpcf","slide":1,"text":"•","textPreview":"•","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[788,118,16,19.5]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/svqpgzad","slide":1,"text":"不能只做“Metal kernel → CUDA kernel”的语法级替换；真正要迁移的是 streamed-MoE 的控制面思想。","textPreview":"不能只做“Metal kernel → CUDA kernel”的语法级替换；真正要迁移的是 streamed-MoE 的控制面思想。","textChars":67,"textLines":1,"bbox":[804,118,460,21.5]}
