{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6t8neps7","slide":1,"text":"必须把冷数据读取、expert cache、decode scheduler、service interface 全部从苹果黑盒依赖中解耦出来。","textPreview":"必须把冷数据读取、expert cache、decode scheduler、service interface 全部从苹果黑盒依赖中解耦出来。","textChars":72,"textLines":1,"bbox":[804,172,460,21.5]}
